
Fact domain Identified by A,B,C,D,E
Fact codomain Identified by 1..5

Function f Identified by domain * codomain.

?(Forall codomain: Not(f(A,codomain))).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(B,codomain))).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(C,codomain))).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(D,codomain))).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(E,codomain))).

+f(A,1).
+f(B,2).
+f(C,3).
+f(D,4).
+f(E,5).

?(Forall codomain: Not(f(A,codomain)) When codomain != 1).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(B,codomain)) When codomain != 2).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(C,codomain)) When codomain != 3).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(D,codomain)) When codomain != 4).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(E,codomain)) When codomain != 5).

+f(C,1).

?(Forall codomain: Not(f(A,codomain)) When codomain != 1).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(B,codomain)) When codomain != 2).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(C,codomain)) When codomain != 1).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(D,codomain)) When codomain != 4).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(E,codomain)) When codomain != 5).

+f(B,1).
+f(D,1).
+f(E,1).

?(Forall codomain: Not(f(A,codomain)) When codomain != 1).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(B,codomain)) When codomain != 1).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(C,codomain)) When codomain != 1).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(D,codomain)) When codomain != 1).
?(Forall codomain: Not(f(E,codomain)) When codomain != 1).


